        <p>. . (3,,Ap,lneeting of cbop assistants was held at Coe .t,) _inn Hotel, Earlestown, on Wednesday evening„ 11, 'a.kt' into consid the• eration • desirability of Pro- t4c)ti.'irlfs' a cl:';ser social intercourse among the assi lets,., -s- -enlPloyed in the various sho;es -of the town. Ilnt Lavvless. presided. and there was a fair attend-, A ce of assi.tants. After some discussion it. wa,,: - - - 1,,, clued that a ball should be held, in the Town Hall . -atlestown, on Wedne*day evening, Jan. 31. at fuller rzirtiCulars to be advertibed nexr, week. ,</p>
