        <p>Special services wers held at Wargrave Church,on Sunday,in aid of the above society. The pulpit was occupied in the morning by the Rev. J. Carson, rec- tor, and in the evening by the Rev. J. Piggott,vicar of St. Thomas's, St. Helens, Wlho preached a sermon dealing with the objects ef the society. Special hymns were sung, and collections were made in aid of the funds.</p>
